{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3e15506b1ce2ee5e","name":"Cheater","source":{"id":"source:reference-3e15506b1ce2ee5e","title":"Cheater","revision":19623,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:18:30Z","sha256":"e3e547aec095ada39c3d5935591f82a752731d1cfd112a9cd900ffadcf79aed0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19623","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cheater&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3e15506b1ce2ee5e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Cheater is a hand-held device designed to allow you to cheat at the popular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gambling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gambling","referenceId":"reference:a34a9dc897175948"}," game of Sabacc. Because they are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"}," (and likely to get you killed to boot), Cheaters usually are disguised and added to another piece of functional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While you use a Cheater, you gain a +2 Equipment bonus on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," check made to determine the outcome of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gambling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gambling","referenceId":"reference:a34a9dc897175948"},". You have to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check opposed by any observers' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks to conceal the use of a Cheater, but you gain a bonus on your check determined by the objects size. (Generally, Cheaters are placed in Fine-sized devices such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Credit Chips"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Credit_Chips"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlinks"},", granting a +10 size bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks to conceal their use.) However, if anyone ever beats your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," check in a Sabacc game by 6 or more, that person realizes you must be cheating somehow (though they won't know exactly how- often leading to a demand for a search of your possessions). A Cheater installed into a rigged Sabacc Card is called a Skifter.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
